7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p082AndKOaAQ7kNvwGzg2yF&_nc_oc=Adq4io9Kj5XlujqtVsc79Vf3d5Bg6f7hMxTXEq-o_JMlbDxVUczdEcqU5kCdtlVPoNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1_gjez-G1A3LJH5Y913S1EeGIh0wp_FVjAoxefj8vjWg&oe=69E8C9D8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2025-02-19 at 14.56.05.png", "id": "25652228037715697", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819464_25652228044382363_5730527552521063876_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=twnlLk3VA08Q7kNvwGpgOX4&_nc_oc=AdrLyLgd3-auUa-LDi3gK3J2n9K3GAnW7taUOwLxUjlgwdzUaOCPk5W9nKpZuETvKlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af01rgnlusHpTc2pGIlWxtJ3KB1fh4eN3HQtyIDiockAyA&oe=69E8AB04"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "2105423356657529", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_2105423363324195_5090811876925984097_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EcRDT7IxhkQQ7kNvwHG1vuv&_nc_oc=AdoEyDU1rvWjkqcidp3tiotlIUkrcH-99GoCV9EFIc82t6e6hDZ1EPJL2adQlx7hTJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3UvhWFeSFdWfqnRbQpm498HdwxFvFhjPpHJBs0pVuZYw&oe=69E8D71F"}, "display_name": "Among Giants", "keywords": ["climbing", "swinging", "bows", "giants", "adventure"], "long_description": "Among Giants is an open-world game where the player gets to explore the planet at their own pace, deciphering the alien language to get a better understanding of what has happened to humanity by hunting down colossal giants that roam the world and extracting their final memories.\n\n# The Giants and Others\nSome of the giants you will hunt and take them down\n{824636457215828}\nThe game has over 10 different types of enemies you will encounter from smaller Droids to a huge Spider Queen\n{830767046537926}\n\n# Meet R-011\nBefriend a feisty tiny Roller Droid, your gateway to understanding this world who will eventually be your closest ally. R-011 will be your Hacker, your Protector and your Friend\n{1332849368154885}\n\n# Your Horse\nExplore the huge alien world by riding your trusty steed. You can call for your horse anywhere with your Horn\n{1412359163842124}\n\n# Your Bow & Arrow\nFind special Quivers for your bow to help tackle those tricky targets\n{1617153256329705}\n\n# Grappling Hooks\nTraverse across the land using your grappling hooks and also use them to break open crates\n{875307924930249}\n\n# Gliding\nOutstretch your arms to glide your way to safety or distant platforms\n{1292691869326168}\n\n# Other Weapons\nThere are many other types of weaponry found in the world but use them wisely as they cannot be reloaded\n{827696256535054}\n\n# Hack Terminals & Locks\nDecipher the alien language a character at a time by hacking terminals and also break into buildings and gates by pick locking\n{1394160675459015}\n\n# Realtime Day & Night with Weather Systems\nThe battleground changes constantly when the day turns to night. Fight through heavy rain, a freezing blizzard and even in a scorching desert\n{1885682562347865}", "short_description": "You are Erya, the lone wanderer on a desolate world. You awaken among colossal giants, with their slow, deliberate movements resembling ancient deities. The world is scattered with robot relics, frozen in anguish, remnants of a lost civilization destroyed by a divine event. Can you uncover a connection between the giants, the planet, and your own origins?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://kmonkeygames.com/games/among-giants/among-giants-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "K Monkey Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.kmonkeygames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "459781504968480